    <p class="reveal"><strong>Ngoc Han Studio</strong><br>Da Nang, Vietnam</p>
    <p class="reveal">Some sessions are also held at ACE Hub, Da Nang, other studios and venues, and outdoors at the beach (weather permitting).</p>

    <div class="announcement-box reveal" style="text-align:left;">
      <h3 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:1.2em;color:#2E5A6B;margin-bottom:0.5em;">Online Courses</h3>
      <p>Looking for structured online training? Full details of all programmes - including Qigong, Qigong Teacher Training, Yoga Teacher Training and Yin Yoga - are available on the <a href="/online-courses/">Online Courses</a> page.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="reveal" style="margin-top:2em;">Private Sessions</h2>
    <p class="reveal">We offer private one-on-one sessions. Seb's private sessions cover multiple Qigong sets with specific applications tailored to your needs. Jenny and Amy's private sessions can focus on Yoga, Sound Healing, breathwork or a combination, as well as various other practices and guidance. Please get in touch to discuss and arrange a time.</p>
